    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong> \u203c\ufe0f Pre-Alpha Game \u203c\ufe0f </strong></h2><br>Windsor is a persistent massively multiplayer grand strategy game currently in the very early stages of development. <br><br><strong>It's like: Age of Empires \ud83d\udc51 and Civilization \ud83c\udf0e had a baby and put every player on the same map.</strong><br><br>\ud83d\udc51 Rule over an empire of other players. Recruit bannermen, receive tributes, and work together to conquer castles.<br>\u23e9 Plan your moves by fast-forwarding in time<br>\u23f1 Play on your own time. Wars take place over days and weeks. <br>\u2694\ufe0f Raise an army of different soldier types, each with different strengths and weaknesses.<br>\ud83d\udcf1 Check in when you're AFK - Windsor is available on your phone. Search for &quot;Windsor Strategy&quot; on your app store of choice<br><br>...and most-importantly, join the community helping to define what Windsor will become. Follow the link to the discord from inside the game.",
